ID DECISION-0002

STATUS APPROVED

DATE 2026-07-27

DECIDED_BY President Cley Duarte

TITLE

The public page publishes together with the first version launch --
decided in chat, and EXECUTED: the repository is public and GitHub Pages
is LIVE at https://cleyduartees-dot.github.io/PACE/ (deploying from
main:/docs). The Kingdom Tale is live at /cuento-del-reino.html.

RAW_TEXT

La pagina la publicamos cuando lanzamos la primera version.

HISTORY_NOTE

Correction of this record's first draft, before it ever entered git
history. The President had confirmed and executed this in chat (repo made
public, Pages enabled at the first version launch), but neither the
decision nor the "site is live" fact was ever captured into .pace/. After
context compaction the AI first treated the decision as new and then
recorded it as a future gate ("on hold until v1.0.0") -- wrong twice,
same root cause: capture failure, not memory failure. The President
caught both ("buscalo en el chat / creo que te lo confirme" + a
screenshot of Pages live). See REQUEST-0016 and RULE-0008.

CONSEQUENCES

F3-17 (GitHub Pages) is DONE, not on hold. The repo is public; BSL 1.1
is the protection layer. Every push to main:/docs redeploys the site
automatically -- the landing and the tale are now live products.

END
